    <article class="post post-1033354 page type-page status-publish hentry" >

           <header class="post-header">
                <h3>Cohiba Brand</h3>
            </header>
            <div class="wpb-content-wrapper"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row-o-full-height vc_row-o-columns-middle vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="400" height="253" src="https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/vista-cohiba-400x253-1.jpg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-full" alt="" title="vista-cohiba-400x253" srcset="https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/vista-cohiba-400x253-1.jpg 400w, https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/vista-cohiba-400x253-1-300x190.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-8"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element vc_custom_1626810817180" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: justify;">Cohiba is the most prestigious brand in the tobacco world and in 2016 it celebrated its 50th anniversary.<br />
It was created in 1966 and for many years it was intended solely as a gift to government personalities, national and foreign, and of course to President Fidel Castro. Since then, it has been manufactured in the prestigious El Laguito factory in Havana.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: justify;">Since 1982, the year in which it is presented in different countries, Cohiba has been available to be enjoyed by the world&#8217;s most demanding smokers in limited quantities.</p>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="900" height="440" data-src="https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/fabrica-laguito.jpg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large lazyload" alt="" title="fabrica-laguito" data-srcset="https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/fabrica-laguito.jpg 900w, https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/fabrica-laguito-300x147.jpg 300w, https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/fabrica-laguito-768x375.jpg 768w" data-sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" style="--smush-placeholder-width: 900px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 900/440;" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element vc_custom_1626810883257" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: center;"><em style="font-size: 12px;">Factory «El Laguito», in Havana.</em></p>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: justify;">The name &#8220;Cohiba&#8221; is an old word used by the Taíno Indians, original inhabitants of the Island, to define the rolled tobacco leaves that these Indians smoked, and that Christopher Columbus saw for the first time in Cuba in 1492. Cohiba is for hence the first name of tobacco.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">It is the most prestigious brand in the tobacco world, the elite of Habanos. The leaves used in its preparation are &#8220;the selection of the selection&#8221; of the best vegas of &#8220;San Juan y Martínez&#8221; and &#8220;San Luis&#8221;, in the &#8220;Vuelta Abajo&#8221; area of the &#8220;Pinar del Río&#8221; region, Cuba.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">All the Habanos of the Cohiba brand are made “Totalmente a mano&#8221;.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">Cohiba is the only Habanos brand in which two of the three types of leaves used to make it, dry and light, undergo additional fermentation. This special treatment gives Cohiba an unmistakable aroma and flavor, which cannot be found in any other brand.</p>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="680" height="345" data-src="https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/linea-clasica-transp.jpg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large lazyload" alt="" title="linea-clasica-transp" data-srcset="https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/linea-clasica-transp.jpg 680w, https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/linea-clasica-transp-300x152.jpg 300w" data-sizes="(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" style="--smush-placeholder-width: 680px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 680/345;" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element vc_custom_1626795402753" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: center;"><em style="font-size: 12px;">Línea Clásica.</em></p>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: justify;">Cohiba initially launched the Línea Clásica, developed between 1966 and 1989 with its characteristic medium to strong flavor; to which would be joined the Line 1492, with a medium flavor, which was launched in 1992 to commemorate the V Centenary of the arrival of Christopher Columbus on the Island; and later the Cohiba Maduro 5 Line, with a mature layer aged for five years through natural processes, which was launched in 2007 with three new vitolas.</p>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="696" height="407" data-src="https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/linea-1492-transp.jpg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large lazyload" alt="" title="linea-1492-transp" data-srcset="https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/linea-1492-transp.jpg 696w, https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/linea-1492-transp-300x175.jpg 300w" data-sizes="(max-width: 696px) 100vw, 696px" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" style="--smush-placeholder-width: 696px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 696/407;" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element vc_custom_1626796030623" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: center;"><em style="font-size: 12px;">Línea 1492.</em></p>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: justify;">In 2009 the first Gran Reserva de Habanos was presented, under the Cohiba brand with the Siglo VI vitola, emphasizing the unique character of Habanos.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">In 2010, the brand&#8217;s portfolio was expanded with the launch of the new Cohiba Behike line, the most exclusive Habanos, S.A. has ever launched. For the first time, it incorporated Medio Tiempo in its blend, a leaf from the 2 upper leaves of the sun tobacco plant that gives it an exceptional character and flavor.</p>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="738" height="289" data-src="https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/linea-maduro5-transp.jpg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large lazyload" alt="" title="linea-maduro5-transp" data-srcset="https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/linea-maduro5-transp.jpg 738w, https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/linea-maduro5-transp-300x117.jpg 300w" data-sizes="(max-width: 738px) 100vw, 738px" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" style="--smush-placeholder-width: 738px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 738/289;" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element vc_custom_1626795678477" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: center;"><em style="font-size: 12px;">Línea Maduro 5.</em></p>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: justify;">In 2021, Cohiba turns 55 and has developed a broad portfolio and, in addition, has been present as a priority in the development of special products, which include products that are introduced to the market on a very limited and exclusive basis.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">Cohiba, at 55, continues to be a brand in continuous renewal and innovation, always desired and attractive to current and future fans.</p>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="661" height="376" data-src="https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/linea-behike-transp.jpg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large lazyload" alt="" title="linea-behike-transp" data-srcset="https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/linea-behike-transp.jpg 661w, https://www.habanos.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/linea-behike-transp-300x171.jpg 300w" data-sizes="(max-width: 661px) 100vw, 661px" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" style="--smush-placeholder-width: 661px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 661/376;" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element vc_custom_1626795697606" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: center;"><em style="font-size: 12px;">Behike.</em></p>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: justify;">Through this constant innovation, Cohiba is always the avant-garde brand that leads the trends in the world of Habano, being the first to introduce a Reserva in 2002, and a Gran Reserva in 2009, which were made with leaves of tobacco aged a minimum of 3 and 5 years respectively.<br />
Cohiba, is synonymous with exclusivity, of the highest quality, but also of something beyond the senses, a unique experience for lovers of considered the best tobacco in the world.</p>
